      "role": "user",
      "content": "right, so it's basically about the difference between documented stuff and just stuff that's stuck in my brain. so if i'm sitting there coding a new project and i just happen to use a specific way of structuring a data pipeline that i remember from this client, because it just feels 'more efficient' and i'm not looking at any docs... that's fine as long as it's not a direct copy of their proprietary code?",
